WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.891
Jason led Vinnie and Mandy out of the house.

2
00:00:19.671 --> 00:00:21.172
"We'll pass through the agora.

3
00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:25.194
It is the heart of our city," said Jason.

4
00:00:25.214 --> 00:00:29.736
"This is where people buy and sell things.

5
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.921
We make the laws of Athens here too.

6
00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:38.484
Men, women, and slaves can be together in the agora."

7
00:00:42.046 --> 00:00:44.548
Suddenly, Mandy pulled Vinnie's arm.

8
00:00:45.388 --> 00:00:46.409
"Look at that!"

9
00:00:47.029 --> 00:00:48.130
She pointed upward.

10
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:52.632
"Whoa!" Vinnie said, stopping.

11
00:00:53.813 --> 00:00:56.374
He stared up at a tall, rocky hill.

12
00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:59.616
Many stairs led up to the top.

13
00:01:00.592 --> 00:01:02.654
At the top were many buildings.

14
00:01:02.674 --> 00:01:07.778
"There's the Parthenon," said Jason.

15
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:09.499
"Isn't it great?"

16
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.603
He pointed out a large building surrounded by tall, white columns.

17
00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:18.326
"It's beautiful!"

18
00:01:18.907 --> 00:01:19.928
Mandy gasped.

19
00:01:21.309 --> 00:01:23.611
"I can surely tell you're not from here.

20
00:01:24.591 --> 00:01:25.832
Where are you from?"

21
00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:27.273
Jason asked.

22
00:01:28.494 --> 00:01:29.615
"From New Jersey."

23
00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.445
Vinnie said nervously.

24
00:01:32.465 --> 00:01:38.831
"I have never heard of New Jersey," said Jason, frowning.

25
00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:41.253
They reached the agora.

26
00:01:41.793 --> 00:01:43.155
People were everywhere.

27
00:01:43.175 --> 00:01:46.017
"Jason!" a man called.

28
00:01:46.037 --> 00:01:47.959
"Here's some bread.

29
00:01:48.239 --> 00:01:49.900
You have to eat a lot to win the race!"

30
00:01:50.581 --> 00:01:51.842
He held out a loaf.

31
00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:54.144
"Thank you!"

32
00:01:54.845 --> 00:01:55.605
said Jason.

33
00:01:57.287 --> 00:02:01.513
Another voice yelled, "Jason, your lyre has been fixed!

34
00:02:02.313 --> 00:02:03.794
Come by later to pick it up."

35
00:02:06.395 --> 00:02:08.016
"Can you play that instrument?"

36
00:02:08.656 --> 00:02:09.316
asked Vinnie.

37
00:02:10.317 --> 00:02:12.158
"Sure," said Jason.

38
00:02:12.178 --> 00:02:14.779
"I learn music at the gymnasium."

39
00:02:14.799 --> 00:02:17.180
"Good luck, Jason!"

40
00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.521
called out three more voices.

41
00:02:19.541 --> 00:02:26.964
"I will compete in the sprint race at the Olympic Games," said Jason.

42
00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:29.777
"The race will be held in Olympia.

43
00:02:30.437 --> 00:02:33.719
I am the youngest runner, but I am the fastest."

44
00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:38.020
"I love watching the Olympics!"

45
00:02:38.781 --> 00:02:39.581
said Mandy.

46
00:02:40.782 --> 00:02:44.103
Jason stared at her with his mouth wide open.

47
00:02:44.123 --> 00:02:47.204
"Women are not allowed to watch the games!"

48
00:02:47.224 --> 00:02:52.166
"Jason!" a tall man called out.

49
00:02:53.327 --> 00:02:55.688
He was a few years older than Jason.

50
00:02:56.788 --> 00:02:58.769
He walked up to Mandy and Vinnie.

51
00:02:58.789 --> 00:03:00.810
"My name is Milo.

52
00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.991
I am the fastest runner in Athens!"

53
00:03:03.011 --> 00:03:08.733
"But I thought said Vinnie, pointing to Jason.

54
00:03:08.753 --> 00:03:11.174
"Did he tell you he was the best?

55
00:03:11.495 --> 00:03:13.556
Ha-ha!" laughed Milo.

56
00:03:13.576 --> 00:03:17.757
"Everyone knows that I will wear the olive wreath of victory this year!"

57
00:03:17.777 --> 00:03:23.260
"Milo, stop bragging," said Jason with a half smile.

58
00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:28.211
"After the race begins, you will see me far ahead of you!"

59
00:03:29.132 --> 00:03:30.252
He turned to Mandy.

60
00:03:30.272 --> 00:03:34.395
"You must stay in the agora now," Jason said.

61
00:03:34.996 --> 00:03:36.557
"We're going to the gymnasium."

62
00:03:37.798 --> 00:03:42.361
Surprised, Mandy cried, "No, I want to come with you!"

63
00:03:43.201 --> 00:03:44.502
Jason shook his head.

64
00:03:44.522 --> 00:03:47.064
"Girls aren't allowed inside.

65
00:03:47.985 --> 00:03:50.066
You must wait here until we come out."

66
00:03:51.147 --> 00:03:52.648
Mandy stamped her foot.

67
00:03:53.234 --> 00:03:55.025
She hated being left out.
